
"smart_sources:2026-07-28 - States may soon manage grizzly bears after exceeding recovery goals.md": {"path":"2026-07-28 - States may soon manage grizzly bears after exceeding recovery goals.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"t24vy7","at":1785795033967},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1785443774253,"size":4019,"at":1785795034037,"hash":"t24vy7"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,40]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Kaelyn Blessinger","target":"Kaelyn Blessinger","line":5},{"title":"**News**","target":"https://localnews8.com/category/news/","line":10},{"title":"United States Fish & Wildlife Service","target":"https://www.fws.gov/press-release/2026-07/secretary-burgum-returns-management-grizzly-bears-west","line":34},{"title":"here","target":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/17/2026-14450/endangered-and-threatened-wildlife-and-plants-grizzly-bear-listing-on-the-list-of-endangered-and#open-comment","line":36},{"title":"News","target":"https://localnews8.com/category/news/","line":38}],"metadata":{"title":"States may soon manage grizzly bears after exceeding recovery goals","source":"https://localnews8.com/news/2026/07/28/states-may-soon-manage-grizzly-bears-after-exceeding-recovery-goals/?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=governor-declares-wildfire-emergency-deploys-guard-idaho-national-guardsmen-accused-of-assault-in-d-c&_bhlid=04766b2301fc7ea7680ccb25963c63177ec4bd1e","author":["[[Kaelyn Blessinger]]"],"published":"2026-07-28","created":"2026-07-30","description":"The federal government is moving to grant states more authority over grizzly bear management following a petition from Montana. This proposal would allow state agencies to regulate populations that have met federal recovery benchmarks. Idaho officials, including Senator Jim Risch and Governor Brad Little, praised the decision, arguing that local wildlife experts are better equipped to make conservation decisions than federal bureaucrats."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},